    "description": "Amethyst Crystal Cluster Lot - 2 Pieces\nNatural Mineral Specimens\nPurple / Lavender, Druzy Geode Formations\nNatural amethyst crystal clusters featuring dense druzy formations on a contrasting rocky matrix. These specimens display the characteristic transition from raw host stone to crystalline purple quartz. Ideal for mineral collectors or home decor, these pieces represent the natural beauty of geode interiors.\nPieces Included:\nAmethyst Druzy Cluster: Deep purple crystal points with a thick rocky matrix base.\nAmethyst Druzy Cluster: Lavender crystal points with a stable host stone matrix.\nNatural crystalline druzy texture with varying shades of purple\nSolid rock matrix bases providing stability for display\nCombined weight of 1.75 lbs; pair measures approximately 6x5x3 inches\nCondition:\nSpecimens in excellent natural condition. Well-preserved crystal terminations with no post-extraction damage. The matrix is stable and free of crumbling. Natural geological variations in color and structure are present as expected.\nPlease Note:\nThis is a pre-owned item being sold\nas-is\n. We do our best to describe items accurately and include research where possible, but we are not experts in every category. Please note that if the title or description states \"Tested\" that we only test to make sure the unit \"\nPOWERS ON\"\n.\nNo further testing takes place unless stated otherwise and items are considered untested.\nPlease remember all items are used and are sold as is, no refunds.If you have questions, please contact us before bidding.\nFor all vintage clothing, please research sizing before placing a bid.\nItems from different time periods may have measurements that differ from today’s standard sizing.\nCustomer Service:\nReach us via the “Contact Us” link above or by calling\n(540) 361-6550\n. Messages are handled Monday–Friday, 8:00 AM–4:00 PM ET, and we strive to respond within 48 hours.",
